Update project to use Java 21 (LTS) across all build configurations:
- Set java.version to 21 in pom.xml
- Update Gradle toolchain to Java 21 in build.gradle
- Update CI/CD workflows (maven-build.yml, gradle-build.yml) to use Java 21
- Update .devcontainer/Dockerfile to use Java 21
- Update README.md documentation to reflect Java 21 requirement
- Add UPGRADE_EXPLANATION.md documenting the upgrade decision and rationale
- Include upgrade logs for monitoring and audit purposes

Java 21 is an LTS release (September 2023) with support until 2031,
providing extended support timeline and access to modern Java features
including Virtual Threads, Pattern Matching, and Sequenced Collections.

